WEBVTT

00:26:59.938 --> 00:27:01.952
on the other side of this,

00:27:01.976 --> 00:27:04.137
and we're going
to be doing that individually

00:27:04.161 --> 00:27:06.304
and we're going
to be doing that collectively.

00:27:07.715 --> 00:27:11.779
I think of the shoots of small trees

00:27:11.803 --> 00:27:15.438
that can only come up
after massive forest fires,

00:27:15.462 --> 00:27:18.756
where seed pods have to explode
under great heat.

00:27:18.780 --> 00:27:21.288
We're in a kind of crucible
moment right now,

00:27:21.312 --> 00:27:24.042
and I wouldn't begin to have the hubris

00:27:24.066 --> 00:27:27.749
to predict what sort
of creativity will come,

00:27:27.773 --> 00:27:32.344
but look, if history is any measure,
what we'll probably see